Description:This figure illustrates the attractor basins occupied by baseline and chaotic trajectories. The baseline attractor appears as a stable, repeating structure, while the chaotic attractor exhibits stretched and folded geometry indicative of bifurcation. The map highlights the separation between attractor regions, confirming the existence of multiple stable futures.

